objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.1 NAME 'ciamObject' DESC 'Base of eve
 ry operations-directory entry' SUP top ABSTRACT MAY ( description $ ciamOwn
 er $ ciamLastChanged $ ciamChangeRef ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
