objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.28 NAME 'ciamCertificate' DESC 'Certi
 ficate (public facts only)' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamFinge
 rprint $ ciamNotAfter $ ciamCertPurpose ) MAY ( ciamSubject $ ciamIssuer $ 
