 ruction' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamTitle $ ciamLastValidate
 d ) MAY ( ciamVersion $ ciamAppliesTo $ ciamDocUrl ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.30 NAME 'ciamChange' DESC 'Change rec
 ord (mirrored from ITSM)' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamTitle $
  ciamChangeStatus ) MAY ( ciamApprovedBy $ ciamPlannedAt ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir
 ' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.31 NAME 'ciamIncident' DESC 'Incident
  / postmortem' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamTitle $ ciamOpened
 At ) MAY ( ciamSeverity $ ciamInvolved $ ciamRootCause ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' 
 )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.32 NAME 'ciamParty' DESC 'Team, partn
 er, vendor, or the operator of the platform' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST
  ( cn $ ciamOwnerKind ) MAY ( mail $ ciamContactUrl $ ciamDisplayName ) X-O
