objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.33 NAME 'ciamStackComponent' DESC 'On
 e component of an environment stack: the adapter that fills a role' SUP cia
 mObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamStackRole $ ciamAdapter ) MAY ( ciamAdap
 terVersion $ ciamAdapterSource ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.34 NAME 'ciamUserObjectClass' DESC 'R
