 efinition of a custom field' SUP ciamCustomDefinition STRUCTURAL MUST ( cia
 mValueType $ ciamPortability ) MAY ( ciamMultiValued $ ciamCarriedBy $ ciam
 Unit $ ciamExample $ ciamDefaultValue $ ciamMinValue $ ciamMaxValue $ ciamP
 attern $ ciamMaxLength $ ciamOverridable ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.38 NAME 'ciamRecordTypeDefinition' DE
 SC 'Definition of a custom record type' SUP ciamCustomDefinition STRUCTURAL
  MAY ( ciamRecordKind $ ciamParentType $ ciamRequiredField $ ciamOptionalFi
 eld ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.39 NAME 'ciamConfigFile' DESC 'A conf
 ig file held in the record' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamForma
 t $ ciamRepoPath $ ciamCaptureLevel ) MAY ( ciamTargetRole $ ciamDeployPath
  $ ciamSkeleton $ ciamSha256 $ ciamCaptureProblem ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.40 NAME 'ciamConfigSetting' DESC 'One
  setting of a captured config file' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ c
 iamLocator ) MAY ( ciamSettingValue $ ciamSettingRaw $ ciamValueFrom $ ciam
 SecretRequired $ ciamCaptureProblem ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.41 NAME 'ciamBundle' DESC 'Code, scri
 pts, templates or a package, deployed as a unit: recorded where it lives, n
 ot held in the record' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamRepoPath $
  ciamBundleKind $ ciamSha256 ) MAY ( ciamFormat $ ciamBundleVersion $ ciamT
 argetRole $ ciamDeployPath ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.42 NAME 'ciamCredential' DESC 'A key 
