 ST ( cn $ ciamRepoPath $ ciamSha256 ) MAY ( ciamOnServer $ ciamConcern ) X-
 ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.47 NAME 'ciamOccurrence' DESC 'A valu
 e of the record found in a scanned file: whose, which attribute, on which l
 ines' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamOccurrenceOf $ ciamOccurrin
 gAttr $ ciamLineNumber ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
